Soong's file finder (build/soong/ui/build/finder.go) skips every directory that holds a file
named .find-ignore. This is OCD Check's Gradle app: when this repository is a project of an
Android tree (packages/apps/OcdCarrierSettings), Soong and Kati never walk it. Soong reads only
carriersettings/Android.bp. Never put this file in the repository root or in carriersettings/.
